{"suttaId":"tha-ap431","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[439,489],"vripara":"140"},"segments":{"tha-ap431:0.3":"Sovaṇṇakiṅkaṇiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap431:1.1":"“Saddhāya abhinikkhamma, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ;","tha-ap431:1.3":"Vākacīradharo āsiṃ, tapokammamapassito.","tha-ap431:2.1":"“Atthadassī tu bhagavā, lokajeṭṭho narāsabho;","tha-ap431:2.3":"Uppajji tamhi samaye, tārayanto mahājanaṃ.","tha-ap431:3.1":"“Balañca vata me khīṇaṃ, byādhinā paramena taṃ;","tha-ap431:3.3":"Buddhaseṭṭhaṃ saritvāna, puline thūpamuttamaṃ.","tha-ap431:4.1":"“Karitvā haṭṭhacittohaṃ, sahatthena [pasādena (ka.)] samokiriṃ;","tha-ap431:4.3":"Soṇṇakiṅkaṇipupphāni, udaggamanaso ahaṃ.","tha-ap431:5.1":"“Sammukhā viya sambuddhaṃ, thūpaṃ paricariṃ ahaṃ;","tha-ap431:5.3":"Tena cetopasādena, atthadassissa tādino.","tha-ap431:6.1":"“Devalokaṃ gato santo, labhāmi vipulaṃ sukhaṃ;","tha-ap431:6.3":"Suvaṇṇavaṇṇo tatthāsiṃ, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap431:7.1":"“Asītikoṭiyo mayhaṃ, nāriyo samalaṅkatā;","tha-ap431:7.3":"Sadā mayhaṃ upaṭṭhanti, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap431:8.1":"“Saṭṭhituriyasahassāni [saṭṭhitūriya …(ka.)], bheriyo paṇavāni ca;","tha-ap431:8.3":"Saṅkhā ca ḍiṇḍimā tattha, vaggū vajjanti [nadanti (sī.), vadanti (pī.)] dundubhī.","tha-ap431:9.1":"“Cullāsītisahassāni, hatthino samalaṅkatā;","tha-ap431:9.3":"Tidhāpabhinnamātaṅgā, kuñjarā saṭṭhihāyanā.","tha-ap431:10.1":"“Hemajālābhisañchannā, upaṭṭhānaṃ karonti me;","tha-ap431:10.3":"Balakāye gaje ceva, ūnatā me na vijjati.","tha-ap431:11.1":"“Soṇṇakiṅkaṇipupphānaṃ, vipākaṃ anubhomahaṃ;","tha-ap431:11.3":"Aṭṭhapaññāsakkhattuñca, devarajjamakārayiṃ.","tha-ap431:12.1":"“Ekasattatikkhattuñca, cakkavattī ahosahaṃ;","tha-ap431:12.3":"Pathabyā rajjaṃ ekasataṃ, mahiyā kārayiṃ ahaṃ.","tha-ap431:13.1":"“So dāni amataṃ patto, asaṅkhataṃ sududdasaṃ [gambhīraṃ duddasaṃ padaṃ (syā.)];","tha-ap431:13.3":"Saṃyojanaparikkhīṇo, natthi dāni punabbhavo.","tha-ap431:14.1":"“Aṭṭhārase kappasate, yaṃ pupphamabhiropayiṃ;","tha-ap431:14.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap431:15.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap431:16.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap431:17.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap431:18.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā sovaṇṇakiṅkaṇiyo thero imā Gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap431:19.1":"Sovaṇṇakiṅkaṇiyattherassāpadānaṃ navamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
